# Sprint 1 smoke test. Works with Auth:Mode = "Dev" (appsettings.Development.json).
@host = http://localhost:5043
@user = a_seitkali@kbtu.kz

### US-01: who am I
GET {{host}}/api/me
X-Dev-User: {{user}}

### US-01: a non-KBTU account is rejected (403)
GET {{host}}/api/me
X-Dev-User: someone@gmail.com

### US-02: post a found item (category 2 = Electronics)
POST {{host}}/api/items
X-Dev-User: {{user}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "AirPods Pro case",
  "description": "White, small scratch on the lid",
  "category": 2,
  "cabinet": "Library · 2nd floor",
  "heldAt": "With finder",
  "foundAt": "2026-10-27T11:30:00+05:00"
}

### US-02: a date in the future -> 400 with errors.FoundAt
POST {{host}}/api/items
X-Dev-User: {{user}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Keys",
  "category": 4,
  "cabinet": "Dorms",
  "foundAt": "2099-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### US-03: open Electronics items, newest first
GET {{host}}/api/items?category=2&status=0&page=1&pageSize=20
X-Dev-User: {{user}}

### Item by its short number (Nº 0001)
GET {{host}}/api/items/1
X-Dev-User: {{user}}

### My posts
GET {{host}}/api/items?mine=true
X-Dev-User: {{user}}
